cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "BAM Extraction Benchmark (PW2)"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for extracting text, tables, formulas and measurement records from BAM
  technical documents with locally run, open-weight systems. It has a public track of
  reference-material certificates and a confidential track of internal reports, one
  scorer for both, and a dashboard with a leaderboard.
authors:
  - family-names: Dubbaka
    given-names: Priyanka
    affiliation: "Bundesanstalt für Materialforschung und -prüfung (BAM)"
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/PriyankaDubbaka/Benchmark"
keywords:
  - document parsing
  - optical character recognition
  - table recognition
  - vision language models
  - benchmark
  - reference materials
